# Firebase web settings for the shared count of lit diyas
# (Firebase console → Project settings → Your apps → Web app).
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill it in.
# These values are not secret: they end up in the site's code, and the
# Firestore security rules (see the README) are what protect the data.
# Without them, the dev server pretends other people are lighting their diyas,
# and a production build has no waiting bar: lighting the diya is enough.
API_KEY=
PROJECT_ID=
